{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_16201230","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16201230","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1620122001:":{"text":"……小石头？","source_cn":"……小石头？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF8775C561EE53E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1620123001:1":{"text":"小石头……真的是它。可……它怎么会来这里？","source_cn":"小石头……真的是它。可……它怎么会来这里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E2D285FBD92139E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1620123002:1":{"text":"教授，你认识那只小猫灵吗？","source_cn":"教授，你认识那只小猫灵吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DAFC3D557D7AF3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1620123003:1":{"text":"嗯。虽然只有一瞬间，但我很确定，那就是我生前养的魔宠。它的名字叫做<style=\"highlight\">小石头</style>。","source_cn":"嗯。虽然只有一瞬间，但我很确定，那就是我生前养的魔宠。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49F27D12BDC61D66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1620123004:1":{"text":"没想到教授一直在找的墓地作乱的犯人，竟然是她以前的魔宠……","source_cn":"没想到教授一直在找的墓地作乱的犯人，竟然是她以前的魔宠……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F275F193496ACD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","docu